  "analysis_notes": [
    "Use Language_ID and Parameter_ID for the language-level coding while retaining multivalued keys. Use usages.csv Marker_ID, which references the marker row's ID in values.csv, for conditions and example links.",
    "The selected 27-entry sample and shared lexical/grammar sources must be assessed before generalizing across languages. The 96 examples can illustrate patterns but provide no representative corpus denominators.",
    "P_WO_DM is no for Udihe while two P-marker usage rows list LR_DISLOCATION and topicality. Preserve both levels and read their conditions before treating summary no as no positional evidence.",
    "The published marker type spelling Posposition occurs on qiang_02. The raw table has that same spelling."
